      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_trailer_offset_must_fit_usermeta_len_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 14,
      "description": "After `frame_get_usermeta()` re-executes `get_header_info()`, the function checks only `trailer_offset < 0` and never enforces that `trailer_offset + FRAME_TRAILER_USERMETA_LEN_OFFSET` stays within its local `frame_len`. On the witness, the reparsed `trailer_offset` is the attacker-controlled `header_len` value `0x20202020`, so the positive out-of-range offset reaches the read."
    },
