      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_trailer_offset_reaches_usermeta_len_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 15,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer sink. After the second local parse in `frame_get_usermeta()`, the parser reads the 4-byte usermeta length from a pointer computed with the unchecked positive `trailer_offset`, so it dereferences far beyond the 91-byte attacker buffer."
    },
